  - inference serving
  - tool-using agents
  - prefetch
abstract: >-
  Experimental exact-prefix restoration from file-backed storage into resident
  host KV cache during tool execution. Ordinary continuation requests reuse
  the restored prefix through normal cache matching and host-to-device transfer.
  The repository includes pinned source patches and reproducible, controlled
  single-NVIDIA-L4 experiments. Results are workload- and version-specific.
